### Product Catalog API - HTTP Requests
### Use with IntelliJ IDEA HTTP Client or VS Code REST Client

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### ── HEALTH ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Check health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Prometheus metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus

### ── CREATE PRODUCT ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Create product
# @name create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "LAPTOP-001",
  "name": "MacBook Pro 14 M3",
  "description": "Apple M3 Pro chip, 18GB RAM, 512GB SSD",
  "price": 10999.99,
  "category": "Notebooks",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### ── GET / UPDATE / DELETE ───────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get by ID (replace UUID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Update product
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "LAPTOP-001",
  "name": "MacBook Pro 14 M3 - Updated",
  "description": "Updated description",
  "price": 9999.99,
  "category": "Notebooks",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### Delete product
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/products/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### ── LIST ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### List all (paginated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?page=0&size=10

### Filter by category
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/products?category=Notebooks&status=ACTIVE

### ── SEARCH (Elasticsearch) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Full-text search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search/products?q=macbook

### Search with filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search/products?q=pro&category=Notebooks&minPrice=5000&maxPrice=15000&sort=price&order=asc

### ── VALIDATION ERRORS (expect 422) ─────────────────────────────────────────

### Name too short
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "ERR-001",
  "name": "AB",
  "price": 99.99
}

### Price = 0
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "ERR-002",
  "name": "Valid Name",
  "price": 0
}
